{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/35","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/35/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/35/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/35/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/35","id":5708651583,"node_id":"I_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAABVEMcPw","number":35,"title":"内置视图：今天 / 最近七天 / 所有","user":{"login":"Miaotofu01","id":196646782,"node_id":"U_kgDOC7iXfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196646782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12540536715,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAAC63lniw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/labels/ready-for-agent","name":"ready-for-agent","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Fully specified, ready for an AFK agent","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-05T08:13:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T08:17:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":1,"total_blocked_by":1,"blocking":2,"total_blocking":2},"body":"## Parent\n\n#30\n\n## What to build\n\n三个内置视图就是三个写死的视图定义，走和自定义视图**同一条**求值路径：视图定义 + 全量任务缓存 + 当前逻辑日 → 一份排好序的任务列表。求值是**纯函数**，不碰网络、不碰存储，所以可以直接测。\n\n- **今天** = 逾期 ∪ 截止时间落在当前逻辑日内的任务。**逾期置顶并标红，下面才是今天到期的**——「今天」不是一个干净的截止时间区间。\n- **最近七天** = 截止时间落在从今天起的七个逻辑日内。\n- **所有** = 全部未完成任务。v1 让我看不到的就是这一个。\n\n三个视图作为清单列表页里的行出现，用前缀与真实清单区分；进去看到过滤后的任务；在视图里每条任务要显示**属于哪个清单**——视图不是容器，同一个清单名在这里重复显示是必要信息。\n\n与日期有关的判断全部走当前逻辑日，不走自然日。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] 清单列表页里出现三个内置视图，与真实清单一眼可分\n- [ ] 「今天」显示逾期 ∪ 今天到期，逾期置顶且标红\n- [ ] 边界配成 `04:00` 时，凌晨两点看到的仍是同一个逻辑日的截止任务，且截止于昨天 23:00 的任务归在今日而不是被判成逾期\n- [ ] 「最近七天」显示截止时间落在当前逻辑日起七个逻辑日内的任务\n- [ ] 「所有」显示全部未完成任务\n- [ ] 视图求值是纯函数：给定视图定义、缓存与逻辑日，输出确定的、排好序的任务列表\n- [ ] 视图里的每条任务显示所属清单名\n- [ ] 内置视图与自定义视图共用同一条求值路径\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #34\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/35/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/35/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}